# Untitled

Facile synthesis of \(\mathbf{C}_{3}\mathbf{N}_{4}\)-supported metal catalysts for efficient \(\mathbf{CO}_{2}\) photoreduction
Yun-Nan Gong\(^{1,2,\S}\), Bi-Zhu Shao\(^{2,\S}\), Jian-Hua Mei\(^{2}\), Wei Yang\(^{1}\), Di-Chang Zhong\(^{1}\) (✉), and Tong-Bu Lu\(^{1}\)
